WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.360
My motorbike won't start.
I think the chain is loose.

2
00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:08.600
Hello, I'm Enzo, the motorbike mechanic.

3
00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:11.940
I'll check the chain,
and I'll look at the engine.

4
00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:14.400
Can you fix it this morning?

5
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:20.180
Yes. First I tighten the chain.
Then I test the engine.

6
00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:22.620
It's safe when it runs smoothly.
